Interactive render delegate purpose changes through a UsdImagingGL.Engine, from python

A proxy cube, a render sphere and a guide sphere are rendered while the purposes shown by the engine change, through
the showProxy, showRender and showGuides render params. The render delegate is driven by a headless
UsdImagingGL.Engine as a viewport does, see testsuite/common/interactive_engine_test.py. Each render is checked in
test.py, and the last one is compared against the reference image.

author: cyril.pichard@autodesk.com

PARAMS: {'script': '"{}" test.py'.format(usd_python)}
